{
    "title": "Line Race: Police Pursuit",
    "description": "Do you like racing and chasing? Then this is the police game for you! In Line Race you have to run away from the chase, make your way through the police fences and overcome hot slides! Here you can do everything to be the race master!\r\n \r\nCONTROL YOUR SPEED  \r\nDrift, slide, and run from cops! If you go too fast, you'll get off the line and the cops will be able to catch you!\r\n \r\nCHECK OUT ALL THE CARS \r\nChoose a race car for any driving style and any task. The game has auto for drift lovers, as well as for those who prefer the accurate passage of all obstacles. Common, epic or secret cars? No matter, they all are waiting for you!\r\n \r\nBECOME A RACE MASTER\r\nPump up your skills and reaction in dynamic races! Fit into turns, avoid trains and traffic, watch carefully where the cops are waiting for you, and don't forget to collect coins! This is the only way to become the racer \u21161!\r\n \r\nFEATURES\r\n- Addictive gameplay of car racing games\r\n- Simple and convenient one-finger control\r\n- Atmosphere of real street racing and police pursuit\r\n- Lots of cars, cities and tracks\r\n- Nice hyper casual graphics\r\n- Generous rewards and gifts\r\n\r\nLine Race is an intense but fun game! It's fast-paced but easy to control so you can play with just one finger. The main thing is to move from one city to another, change cars and win the car chase!\r\n \r\nTest yourself in Line Race and you are guaranteed hours of exciting races! Ready! Steady! Go!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you like racing and chasing? Then this is the police game for you! In Line Race you have to run away from the chase, make your way through the police fences and overcome hot slides! Here you can do everything to be the race master!<br> <br>CONTROL YOUR SPEED  <br>Drift, slide, and run from cops! If you go too fast, you&#39;ll get off the line and the cops will be able to catch you!<br> <br>CHECK OUT ALL THE CARS <br>Choose a race car for any driving style and any task. The game has auto for drift lovers, as well as for those who prefer the accurate passage of all obstacles. Common, epic or secret cars? No matter, they all are waiting for you!<br> <br>BECOME A RACE MASTER<br>Pump up your skills and reaction in dynamic races! Fit into turns, avoid trains and traffic, watch carefully where the cops are waiting for you, and don&#39;t forget to collect coins! This is the only way to become the racer \u21161!<br> <br>FEATURES<br>- Addictive gameplay of car racing games<br>- Simple and convenient one-finger control<br>- Atmosphere of real street racing and police pursuit<br>- Lots of cars, cities and tracks<br>- Nice hyper casual graphics<br>- Generous rewards and gifts<br><br>Line Race is an intense but fun game! It&#39;s fast-paced but easy to control so you can play with just one finger. The main thing is to move from one city to another, change cars and win the car chase!<br> <br>Test yourself in Line Race and you are guaranteed hours of exciting races! Ready! Steady! Go!",
    "summary": "Drift, slide and step on the gas! Dynamic racing with police chase and fast cars",
